      "id": "6214789f-ae46-4e23-ad7e-a83ab47d271e",
      "name": "[대기] 예약 발송 시간까지 대기",
      "webhookId": "8f9c2835-20e9-4ade-86a1-ffb9edf6ca71"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## [대기]예약 발송 시간까지 대기\n[역할]\n현재 메시지 스케줄의 scheduled_contact_at까지 실행을 대기한다.\n예약 시간이 되면 워크플로우를 재개하여 실제 메시지 생성·발송 처리를 시작한다.\n\n[운영 목적]\n각 스케줄을 독립 실행으로 관리하여 동일 시간대에 여러 발송 스케줄이 존재하더라도 각각 예약 시각에 처리할 수 있도록 한다.",
        "height": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        208,
        160
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "627aab5e-ee51-45c9-a623-2bd17387a38d",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "WITH updated AS (\n    UPDATE public.message_schedules AS ms\n    SET schedule_status =\n        CASE\n            WHEN NULLIF(TRIM(c.phone), '') IS NOT NULL\n             AND cc.withdrawn_at IS NULL\n             AND cc.privacy_consent IS TRUE\n             AND cc.recontact_consent IS TRUE\n\n             AND ms.schedule_type IN (\n                 'contract',\n                 'reconsultation',\n                 'promotion'\n             )\n\n             AND (\n                 ms.schedule_type <> 'promotion'\n                 OR cc.marketing_consent IS TRUE\n             )\n\n            THEN 'processing'\n            ELSE 'skipped'\n        END\n\n    FROM public.customers AS c\n\n    LEFT JOIN public.customer_consents AS cc\n        ON cc.customer_id = c.customer_id\n\n    WHERE ms.schedule_id = $1\n      AND ms.customer_id = c.customer_id\n      AND ms.schedule_status = 'scheduled'\n\n    RETURNING\n        ms.schedule_id,\n        ms.schedule_status\n)\n\nSELECT\n    $1::varchar AS schedule_id,\n\n    COALESCE(\n        (SELECT schedule_status FROM updated),\n        'unchanged'\n    ) AS result_status,\n\n    EXISTS (\n        SELECT 1\n        FROM updated\n        WHERE schedule_status = 'processing'\n    ) AS processing_started,\n\n    $2::jsonb AS message_data;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [\n  $json.schedule_id,\n  JSON.stringify($json.message_data)\n] }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        528,
        0
      ],
